    "body": "Oh, but for CSS links, we do need to know downstream if it is [CORS-same-origin](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#link-type-stylesheet:concept-css-style-sheet-origin-clean-flag), so I'll go ahead and inline the use of unsafe response.",
